l>Fig.&#x000a0;4</label><caption><p>The CXCR-1 mRNA transcripts were detected as 257 bp band using the reverse transcriptase polymerase chain reaction. Each lane represents the following: 1; asymptomatic normal control, 2; endoscopy-negative GERD patient, 3&#x02013;5; reflux esophagitis patients, 6; non-template negative control and 7; positive control.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="jcbn2007043f04"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>